            "in": "query",
            "description": "The returned current route format, `LAT_LNG_LIST_TYPE` (in `Trip.route`), or `ENCODED_POLYLINE_TYPE` (in `Trip.current_route_segment`). The default is `LAT_LNG_LIST_TYPE`.",
